# ABP Domain-Driven Design

## Core Concepts
- **Entities**: Objects with identity and lifecycle
- **Aggregate Roots**: Consistency boundaries
- **Value Objects**: Immutable objects defined by attributes
- **Domain Services**: Cross-aggregate business logic
- **Repositories**: Aggregate persistence abstraction
- **Domain Events**: Notify domain changes

## Application Layer
- **Application Services**: Orchestrate use cases
- **DTOs**: Transfer data between layers
- **Validation**: Input validation

## Best Practices
- Keep entities behavior-rich
- Protect invariants in aggregates
- Reference aggregates by ID only
- One repository per aggregate root
- Application services coordinate, domain services implement
